{"q": 19699, "quiz": 1598, "obj": "P4.CRAFT_MOVE", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "After the names Phobos and Deimos, the writer asks you a question about our moon's name. Why?", "why": "الحيلة سؤال يوجَّه إلى القارئ مباشرة بعد اسمَي قمرَي المريخ ليشركه ويمازحه: «Don’t you wish our moon had a cool name like that?»", "opts": [{"t": "To ask scientists for a new name.", "dx": "JUMP", "key": false}, {"t": "To laugh at Phobos and Deimos.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}, {"t": "To give the real name of our moon.", "dx": "JUMP", "key": false}, {"t": "To talk to you, the reader, in a fun way.", "dx": null, "key": true}]},
{"q": 19700, "quiz": 1598, "obj": "P4.FIT", "kind": "mcq", "was": "judge", "body": "At the end, the writer asks you a question about the next new moon. Is this a good question for the end of the book?", "why": "الخاتمة «Where do you think scientists will confirm a moon next?» تفي بما قبلها: «Planets can also gain or lose moons over time. The numbers are constantly changing.»", "opts": [{"t": "No. The book is only about the sun and its gravity.", "dx": "PART", "key": false}, {"t": "No. Scientists know every moon of every planet.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}, {"t": "Yes. The numbers of moons change all the time.", "dx": null, "key": true}, {"t": "Yes. Earth has 95 moons now, like Jupiter.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}]},
{"q": 20019, "quiz": 1652, "obj": "P1.COMPETITOR", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "How far was Cora's home from the volcano?", "why": "في النص أرقام عدّة تتنافس (15 و1991 و6)، والمطلوب المسافة: «I lived near Subic Bay, which is about 20 miles away from the volcano.»", "opts": [{"t": "About 6 miles away.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "About 50 miles away.", "dx": null, "key": false}, {"t": "About 20 miles away.", "dx": null, "key": true}, {"t": "About 15 miles away.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}]},
{"q": 20020, "quiz": 1652, "obj": "P1.PARAPHRASE", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "Why did Cora stay at home?", "why": "السؤال يعيد صياغة سؤال كيسي «Why didn't you evacuate?» وجوابه: «I believed I lived far enough away from the volcano that I wouldn't be affected that much.»", "opts": [{"t": "She thought her home was far enough from the volcano.", "dx": null, "key": true}, {"t": "She wanted to see the lava from her apartment.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}, {"t": "She thought it was only thunder and lightning.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "She wanted to wait for her sister at home.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}]},
{"q": 20021, "quiz": 1652, "obj": "P2.UNSIGNALLED", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "Why did buildings collapse in the eruption?", "why": "السبب يُجمع من موضعين بلا أداة ربط: «collapsed buildings from the thick ash on the roofs» ثم قولها في آخر الحوار «Ashes can be very heavy!»", "opts": [{"t": "The ash on the roofs was thick and heavy.", "dx": null, "key": true}, {"t": "The lightning came down on the roofs.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "The water in the apartments was too deep.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "The lava from the volcano ran into the town.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}]},
{"q": 20022, "quiz": 1652, "obj": "P3.MAIN_PARA", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "What is the big idea of the second paragraph?", "why": "الفقرة الثانية كلها عمّا بعد الثوران: الرماد «It was hard to walk, and it was hard to breathe.» والتنظيف «It took months to clean up.» والطعام «the prices doubled».", "opts": [{"t": "Life was very hard after the eruption.", "dx": null, "key": true}, {"t": "Cora saw hot lava near her home.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}, {"t": "Cora was scared in the dark at noon.", "dx": "TASK", "key": false}, {"t": "The eruption started with earthquakes.", "dx": "TASK", "key": false}]},
{"q": 20023, "quiz": 1652, "obj": "P4.WORD_CHOICE", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "Cora uses the words \"dark like midnight\" for the sky around noon. Why does she use the word \"midnight\"?", "why": "اختارت أشدّ ساعات الليل ظلمة لتصف ظهيرة بلا شمس: «Around noon, it was dark like midnight. We didn't see the sun until 6 a.m. the next day.»", "opts": [{"t": "To show how bright the night was.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}, {"t": "To give the time of the eruption.", "dx": "LITR", "key": false}, {"t": "To show how tired she was that day.", "dx": "JUMP", "key": false}, {"t": "To show how very dark the day was.", "dx": null, "key": true}]},
{"q": 20024, "quiz": 1652, "obj": "P4.REASON_SUPPORTS", "kind": "mcq", "was": "judge", "body": "Cora says, \"I was very, very scared.\" Does her story give good reasons for this?", "why": "قولها تسنده روايتها: «powerful earthquakes began shaking the ground» و«Then volcanic ashes began falling on everything.» و«Volcanic tremors shook my apartment.»", "opts": [{"t": "No. She was far away, and nothing came to her town.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}, {"t": "Yes. Hot lava ran into her apartment.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}, {"t": "No. She had electricity and light all night.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}, {"t": "Yes. The ground shook, and ashes came down on everything.", "dx": null, "key": true}]},
{"q": 19953, "quiz": 1641, "obj": "P1.COMPETITOR", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "What did the astronomers from NASA find around TRAPPIST - 1?", "why": "في النص عددان وأشياء عدّة تتنافس، والمطلوب ما اكتُشف: «have discovered seven new exoplanets revolving around another star called TRAPPIST - 1?»", "opts": [{"t": "Three new Space Bugs.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "Seven new dwarf stars.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "Seven new exoplanets.", "dx": null, "key": true}, {"t": "Three new dwarf planets.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}]},
{"q": 19954, "quiz": 1641, "obj": "P2.WORD_CONTEXT", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "What is an \"exoplanet\"?", "why": "المعنى من جملة التعريف نفسها: «Exoplanet is a planet that orbits (revolves around) another star outside our solar system.»", "opts": [{"t": "A star with seven planets around it.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "A planet with amazing rings, like Saturn.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "A planet around a star outside our solar system.", "dx": null, "key": true}, {"t": "A dwarf planet in our solar system, like Pluto.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}]},
{"q": 19955, "quiz": 1641, "obj": "P1.PARAPHRASE", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "In the morning, Amma says \"Astronaut Raghu\" to her son. How does she know about his dream?", "why": "السؤال يعيد صياغة قول الأم بلفظ آخر: «You mumbled it all in your sleep, Astronaut Raghu.»", "opts": [{"t": "She read about it in the newspapers.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "He talked about it in his sleep.", "dx": null, "key": true}, {"t": "He told her about it before bed.", "dx": "JUMP", "key": false}, {"t": "Appa told her about it at night.", "dx": "JUMP", "key": false}]},
{"q": 19956, "quiz": 1641, "obj": "P1.PARAPHRASE", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "Appa thinks about a second earth in space. Why?", "why": "السؤال يعيد صياغة قول الأب: «The news says three out of the seven planets may have water. So may be there is another earth somewhere else too.»", "opts": [{"t": "Maybe some of the new planets have people.", "dx": "GAP", "key": false}, {"t": "Maybe some of the new planets have water.", "dx": null, "key": true}, {"t": "Maybe NASA has a ship near the new planets.", "dx": "JUMP", "key": false}, {"t": "Maybe Raghu saw the new planets in his dream.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}]},
{"q": 19957, "quiz": 1641, "obj": "P4.CRAFT_MOVE", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "In the dream, the writer uses the words \"Swish ... Swoosh ... Dump!\" What do these words do?", "why": "الحيلة كلمات تحاكي الصوت، تأتي بين الأمر «Use the ultra-sonic bug catcher.» والنتيجة «All the Space Bugs caught.» فنسمع الصيد: «Swish ... Swoosh ... Dump!»", "opts": [{"t": "They are the noises of the bug catcher.", "dx": null, "key": true}, {"t": "They are words from Earth to Raghu.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "They are the numbers before the trip.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "They are the names of the Space Bugs.", "dx": "JUMP", "key": false}]},
