{"q": 20475, "quiz": 1728, "obj": "P1.COMPETITOR", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "What kind of engineer builds a bridge, a tower and a road?", "why": "في النص ثمانية أنواع من المهندسين تتنافس، والمطلوب صاحب الجسر والبرج والطريق: «When I build these structures, I will be a civil engineer.»", "opts": [{"t": "An environmental engineer.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "A civil engineer.", "dx": null, "key": true}, {"t": "An aerospace engineer.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "A marine engineer.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}]},
